{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Enter a unique and fantastic world!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378330/extras/RT_Enter_a_fantastic_world01.gif?t=1749487918\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On your journey, you\u2019ll explore a world as beautiful as it is mysterious. Light your path with the help of the Flame and uncover diverse biomes and villages along the way. Venture into shadowy mines, enchanted forests, desolate deserts and uncover new mysteries at every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Fish, pull and mine!</strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378330/extras/InventorySorting.gif?t=1749487918\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During your journey, you\u2019ll gather resources to aid your quest. Equip your fishing rod, pickaxe, and gloves to collect fish, minerals, and roots. All essential to progress and unlock new biomes and locations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Sell your goods</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378330/extras/SellingMinigame.gif?t=1749487918\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Using a tile-based inventory system, you\u2019ll need to carefully puzzle your goods together to sell them efficiently. Help townsfolks by delivering the items they need to earn funds and unlock new upgrades in each village.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Rebuild a world in ruins!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378330/extras/RT_Rebuild_ruined_towns01.gif?t=1749487918\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet the inhabitants of Aurteris! Each one has a unique story and a village they call home. But as their faith in the Flame faded, their towns began to crumble. Reignite their hope, gather resources, and help them rebuild their homes to earn their trust and favor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Rekindle the light!</strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378330/extras/RT_Re-ignite_the_world_Test01.gif?t=1749487918\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You might long to savor your journey through Aurteris, but the Flame holds your soul, and it does not forgive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Restore faith to the forgotten, gather gold, relics, and resolve, and reignite the light that once illuminated this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Obey, Soul\u2026 and perhaps you\u2019ll earn your second chance.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br><br></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3378330?t=1749487918","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378330/b5b4fe767ccb350d99dc5add1bf405e11bba6324/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749487918","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378330/4b144ef666226f17048cc4153e9ae7a82e719580/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749487918","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378330/4b144ef666226f17048cc4153e9ae7a82e719580/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749487918","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3378390,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Enter a unique and fantastic world!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378330/extras/RT_Enter_a_fantastic_world01.gif?t=1749487918\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On your journey, you\u2019ll explore a world as beautiful as it is mysterious. Light your path with the help of the Flame and uncover diverse biomes and villages along the way. Venture into shadowy mines, enchanted forests, desolate deserts and uncover new mysteries at every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Fish, pull and mine!</strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378330/extras/InventorySorting.gif?t=1749487918\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During your journey, you\u2019ll gather resources to aid your quest. Equip your fishing rod, pickaxe, and gloves to collect fish, minerals, and roots. All essential to progress and unlock new biomes and locations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Sell your goods</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378330/extras/SellingMinigame.gif?t=1749487918\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Using a tile-based inventory system, you\u2019ll need to carefully puzzle your goods together to sell them efficiently. Help townsfolks by delivering the items they need to earn funds and unlock new upgrades in each village.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Rebuild a world in ruins!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378330/extras/RT_Rebuild_ruined_towns01.gif?t=1749487918\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet the inhabitants of Aurteris! Each one has a unique story and a village they call home. But as their faith in the Flame faded, their towns began to crumble. Reignite their hope, gather resources, and help them rebuild their homes to earn their trust and favor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Rekindle the light!</strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378330/extras/RT_Re-ignite_the_world_Test01.gif?t=1749487918\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You might long to savor your journey through Aurteris, but the Flame holds your soul, and it does not forgive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Restore faith to the forgotten, gather gold, relics, and resolve, and reignite the light that once illuminated this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Obey, Soul\u2026 and perhaps you\u2019ll earn your second chance.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br><br></p>","developers":["Kiwick"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378330/9111c66526baa9058241b5baccd35e7ab64c897d/header.jpg?t=1749487918","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257153640,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257153640/movie480.mp4?t=1749483970","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257153640/movie_max.mp4?t=1749483970"},"name":"Rekindled Trails Demo Gameplay Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257153640/56ad62f02ee0604207e9ec976d1e0c7fe6dbb680/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749483970","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257153640/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749483970","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257153640/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749483970"}},